    break missing, deleted, draft or delisted (A5)
        App-->>Ctl: BizException PRODUCT_NOT_FOUND (CATALOG_404_001)
        Ctl-->>Visitor: 404, one answer for all four cases
    end
    Note over App,R: B8 (and B3 for a whole page): cache-aside lookup
    App->>Q: findBestOpenDealsByProductIds([productId])
    Q->>C: findByProductIds(ids)
    C-->>Q: Lookup(hits, available); available false if Valkey fails (E3)
    opt ids missing from hits
        Q->>R: findBestOpenDealsByProductIds(missing)
        R-->>Q: List(GroupDeal): cheapest open team per product, ties by lowest id
        Q->>Q: toOffer(deal)
        opt lookup.available
            Q->>C: putAll(offers, empty ones included)
        end
    end
    Q-->>App: Map(productId, OpenDealOffer)
    Note over App: prices as in @fig-a-uc01-ds-browse
    App->>App: resolvePrice(product, deal)
    App-->>Ctl: ListingDetailView
    Note over Visitor,Ctl: B9
    Ctl-->>Visitor: 200 Result(ProductDetailResponse)
